#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Theme Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_UI_Theme_Registration)
#    - [Palette Blending](ca://s?q=Explain_Palette_Blending)
#    - [Adaptive Contrast](ca://s?q=Explain_Adaptive_Contrast)
#    - [Theme Variants](ca://s?q=Explain_Theme_Variants)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_theme(name, data)
#         Registers a theme definition.
#
#    - activate(name)
#         Sets active theme.
#
#    - get_active()
#         Returns active theme data.
#
#    - variant(base, intensity)
#         Generates dynamic theme variant.
#
#    - export()
#         Exports active theme as JSON packet.
#
#===============================================================================
#  THEME STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "primary": "#1A73E8",
#      "secondary": "#FFFFFF",
#      "accent": "#FF4081",
#      "background": "#F5F5F5"
#    }
